        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FPH75 3/4\" Diameter Flag Pole Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade of solid brass this flag pole holder is for use with a 3/4\" outside diameter pole. Mounted one to your wall with the matching finish screws. It is available in 9 decorative finishes. Manufactured by <a href=\"/collections/deltana\">Deltana</a>, the nation'\u0019s most complete provider for all your home hardware needs.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-FPH75-size.gif?v=1704354541\" width=\"369\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana FPH75 Pole Holder Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Larger <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-1-inch-flag-pole-holder-deltana-fph10\"><b>1\" Flag Pole Bracket</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FPH75 Pole Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pole Hole Diameter: 3/4\" Round</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FPH75.pdf?v=1704262259\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana FPH75 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
